    bid_size: bytes &size=5;
    # Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message is the same bytes whichever arm the model names: its arms lay them out alike and differ only in what they are called and what they mean, which Ask Price Quote Opening says (Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Opening Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Whole Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Ten Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Hundred Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Thousand Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Ten Thousand Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Hundred Thousand Pair, Ask Price Quote Numeric Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair Negative Million Pair, Ask Price Quote Strategy Quote Message Numeric Pair). They are parsed as AskPriceQuoteStrategyQuoteMessageNumericPair, so which arm applies is left to what is built on the definition.
